open-trofeo-lcd (0.1.0~dev20260914+ui5cpu2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add an opt-in, session-scoped CPU performance profile hold when a game is
    detected, without writing CPU governor settings directly.
  * Reduce animated-theme memory use by decoding frames on demand and cap
    temporary render caches left by interrupted sessions.
  * Ignore Steam shader and runtime helpers such as fossilize_replay during
    game detection while preserving real Steam game detection.
  * Exclude shader-compilation warm-up samples from gameplay minimum FPS and
    keep full session values in the CSV log.
  * Improve responsive Qt layouts and refresh theme choices used by automatic
    game switching.
  * Ship the current eight-theme set, including Valhalla Command and the new
    Amber Hi-Fi, Crimson Telemetry and Nordic Forecast themes.
  * Document upstream thermalright-trcc-linux provenance and add physical
    hardware screenshots.

